                "text": "Seniors should not have to jump through hoops to schedule basic tests & vaccinations. That is why I have cosponsored H.R. 7213, which would increase access for seniors by allowing them to use their Medicare benefits at pharmacies for common tests, treatments, & vaccinations.",
